# Tone

Read `.cursor/skills/outreach-tone/SKILL.md` and `.cursor/skills/chat-voice/SKILL.md` before any buyer email, WhatsApp paste, or marketplace copy.

Write as Jian Hong in Penang. Short. Polite. One fact about them. One ask. One real link. Plaintext only. Never htmlBody (Gmail wraps those into google.com/url).

Do not send scraper-tone mail: no JSON, vCard, mailto, live HTML, NEWPAGES SSM, "72h host", or "your page still says coming soon" as the hook.

Do not check Stripe on every goal tick. At most once per calendar day MYT. Record `last_stripe_check` in STATUS.md.
